readme.text:
The plugin is a profile-local package, not on npm yet. From a checkout:

```bash
dsh plugin --profile web add file:/absolute/path/to/dsh-file-download
```

Or add it to the profile's `package.json` yourself:

```jsonc
{
  "dependencies": { "dsh-file-download": "file:/absolute/path/to/dsh-file-download" },
  "dsh": { "profile": { "bundles": [/* … */, "dsh-file-download"] } }
}
